le":{"paddingTop":0},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-preview-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-preview-card","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"","srcSet":"$undefined","sizes":"$undefined","alt":"65個の点で描くかわいい赤ちゃんカメの甲羅のてんつなぎプリント","width":540,"height":420,"loading":"eager","fetchPriority":"high","decoding":"async","className":"$undefined","style":{"width":"100%","height":"auto","display":"block","borderRadius":16}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-side-ad","children":null}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-details-col","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":["Free ","Cute"," Printable"]}],["$","h1",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem)"},"children":"かわいい赤ちゃんカメ Dot-to-Dot Printable"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","fontSize":"1.05rem","lineHeight":1.65,"margin":"14px 0 20px"},"children":"65個の点を繋げると、愛らしい子ガメが現れます。この簡単な印刷可能なパズルは、幼い学習者が数字の順序、鉛筆の持ち方、集中力を養うのに役立ちます。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-chips","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"chip","children":["Ages:"," ",""]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"chip","children":["Dots:"," 1–",0]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"chip chip--free","children":"100% Free"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"margin":"16px 0"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":8,"fontSize":"0.9rem"},"children":"Difficulty"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"display":"flex","alignItems":"center","gap":10},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"difficulty","role":"img","aria-label":"難易度：3段階中1","style":{"margin":0},"children":[["$","span","1",{"className":"on"}],["$","span","2",{"className":""}],["$","span","3",{"className":""}]]}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.85rem","fontWeight":800,"color":"var(--muted)"},"children":"Easy"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"fun-fact-box","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.3rem"},"aria-hidden":"true","children":"!"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fun fact:"}]," ","ウミガメの赤ちゃんは、海がどちらに向いているかを正確に知って生まれてくる。彼らは本能的に最も明るい水平線、つまり通常は月明かりに照らされた海に向かって這っていくのだ。"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"margin":"20px 0 16px"},"children":null}],["$","p",null,{"className":"asset-note","children":"Printable PDF path is not present in the export JSON."}],"$L10",["$","$L11",null,{"title":"かわいい赤ちゃんカメ 点つなぎプリント - 無料PDF","imageUrl":"","compact":true}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","color":"var(--muted)","marginTop":10,"lineHeight":1.5},"children":"No sign-up needed. Opens as a PDF. Print on US Letter (8.5 × 11 inch) or A4 paper. Free for home and classroom use."}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/ja/cute/","style":{"display":"inline-flex","alignItems":"center","gap":6,"marginTop":18,"fontWeight":800,"color":"#d94f70","textDecoration":"none"},"children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1l729n",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["$","path","x3x0zl",{"d":"M19 12H5"}],"$undefined"]}]," Back to all ","Cute"," puzzles"]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"dot-guide","className":"section","style":{"paddingTop":0,"maxWidth":800,"margin":"0 auto","padding":"0 24px 48px"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem)","marginBottom":12},"children":["かわいい赤ちゃんカメ"," Dot-to-Dot Puzzle Guide"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":28},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"ゆっくり着実に進むことが勝利への道。この陽気な子ガメは新しい友達を作る準備ができています！模様のある甲羅、短い足、そして好奇心旺盛な小さな顔を持つカメは、点を一つずつ描いていくのがとても楽しい動物の一つです。この65個の点を使ったパズルは、カメを一つずつ組み立てていくので、快適な場所を見つけて鉛筆を手に取り、この小さな旅人をページの上に描き上げていきましょう！"}}],[["$","div","1–16",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["1–16"," — ","シェル"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"点1から点16までを描き、カメの丸みを帯びたドーム型の甲羅を描きましょう。甲羅は滑らかで流れるような曲線で構成されているため、安定した手の動きを養うのに最適です。子どもたちには、曲線ごとに一本の線を途切れなく引くように促しましょう。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"カメの甲羅は、鎧のように身に着ける独立した部品ではなく、実際には骨格の一部であり、背骨と肋骨に融合しています。つまり、カメはどれほど大きくなっても、甲羅から抜け出すことはできないのです。"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","17–32",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["17–32"," — ","頭と小さな顔"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"点17から点32までを続けて、カメの丸い頭と愛らしい顔を形作りましょう。ここはパズルの中で最も細かい部分で、短い線が密集しているので、忍耐力と正確さを養うのに最適です。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"カメには歯が全くありません。その代わりに、人間の爪と同じケラチンでできた硬くて鋭い嘴を持っており、それを使って食べ物を捕らえます。"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","33–47",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["33–47"," — ","貝殻模様"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"33番から47番までの点をなぞって、貝殻の上部に装飾模様を描き加えます。これらは大きな図形の中にある短い連結線なので、リズムが少し変わります。ここでペースを落として、それぞれの点を丁寧に配置するのがおすすめです。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"カメの甲羅の模様は、鱗板と呼ばれる節で構成されており、指紋と同じように、全く同じ模様を持つカメは二匹といない。"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","48–65",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["48–65"," — ","脚と尻尾"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"最後に、48番から65番までの点を繋いで、短い4本の足と小さな尻尾を描き加えましょう。ゴールまであと17個の点。ゆっくりと、でも自信に満ちたゴールは、カメにぴったりです。完成したら、笑顔を忘れずに描き加えましょう！"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"カメは身を守るために頭、脚、尾を甲羅の中に完全に引っ込めることができるが、すべてのカメがそうできるわけではない。ウミガメのように、脚やひれが大きすぎて完全に引っ込めることができない種もいる。"]}]]}]]}]]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section","style":{"paddingTop":8},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":["More free ","Cute"," printables"]}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem)"},"children":"You might also like"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-grid","children":[["$","article","cute-puppy-dot-to-dot-puzzle",{"className":"puzzle-card","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/ja/cute/cute-puppy-dot-to-dot-puzzle/","className":"puzzle-image","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/cute-puppy-puzzle-400.webp","srcSet":"/images/cute-puppy-puzzle-400.webp 400w, /images/cute-puppy-puzzle-600.webp 600w, /images/cute-puppy-puzzle-700.webp 700w, /images/cute-puppy-puzzle.webp 420w","sizes":"(max-width: 760px) 92vw, 30vw","alt":"70個の点をつないで現れるかわいい子犬のてんつなぎプリント","width":420,"height":320,"loading":"lazy","fetchPriorit